{
  "dom_id": "step-59919",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Creating a Venn Diagram Given a Description of a Sample Space",
  "problem": "A dietician has $25$ patients, $10$ of whom are smokers, and $12$ of whom have diabetes. None of the diabetic patients are smokers. Represent the corresponding sample space using a Venn diagram.",
  "worked_solution": "Let us call $A$ the event \"The patient is a smoker\" and $B$ the event \"The patient has diabetes.\" \n\nSince none of the diabetic patients are smokers, we draw two non-overlapping circles to represent the events $A$ and $B.$\n\n- Since there are $10$ smokers, we write the number $10$ within the circle $A.$\n\n- Since there are $12$ patients with diabetes, we write the number $12$ within the circle $B.$\n\nThere are $25$ patients in total, so the number of remaining patients is \n\n$$\n25 - 10 - 12 = 3.\n$$\n\nTo represent the $3$ remaining patients, we write the number $3$ outside of the circles $A$ and $B.$\n\nFinally, our Venn diagram looks as follows:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14242110/assets/86855ecd3f1199c9a5c6fbb66ccf08d5b8dd2913d358f52d2c499039ea6fda4d.png)",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-59919\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"59919\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"13070\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-59919\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-2\">Creating a Venn Diagram Given a Description of a Sample Space</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"59919\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-transition: none;\n                            -moz-transition: none;\n                            -ms-transition: none;\n                            -o-transition: none\n                            }\n\n                            .mjx-svg-href {\n                            fill: blue;\n                            stroke: blue\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox {\n                            display: table!important\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox span {\n                            display: table-cell!important;\n                            width: 10000em!important;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage__block {\n                            text-align: center;\n                            margin: 1em 0em;\n                            position: relative;\n                            display: block!important;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            width: 100%\n                            }</style><p>A dietician has <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"2.325ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 1001 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">25</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">